<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.89 vs   0.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.31 vs   0.99</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.02 vs   0.85</p>
<p> Sales		   11.75 vs   9.40</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.29 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.98 vs   1.99</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.56 vs   1.93</p>
<p> Sales		   22.14 vs  19.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer software firm is</p>
<p>Computerland SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
